📄 Problem Statement

You are given a 2D grid of size N × M consisting of lowercase English characters.

From any cell, you can move to any of its 8 adjacent neighbors (including diagonals).

A path is considered valid if:

Each move goes to an adjacent cell
The character in the next cell is strictly greater than the current cell

You are also given a starting character S.

👉 Your task is to compute the length of the longest valid path starting from any cell containing character S.
